OL,3,GNEWSAPMOS clinics 'good start, but more
OL,4,Acan be done'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe launch of a pilot health check
OL,7,Fclinic for women with polyendocrine
OL,8,Fmetabolic ovarian syndrome (PMOS) in
OL,9,FJersey has been described as "a good
OL,10,Fstart", but "more... can be done" for
OL,11,Fthe condition, the head of a health
OL,12,Fgroup has said.
OL,14,FThe metabolic condition, which affects
OL,15,Fup to one in eight women, changes how
OL,16,Fthe ovaries work and was linked to
OL,17,Finfertility and weight gain, the UK's
OL,18,FNHS said.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
