OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.* %%** %%**,$-, *(,% ,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAPMOS clinics 'good start, but more
OL,4,Acan be done'
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt was renamed PMOS from PCOS
OL,7,F(polycystic ovary syndrome) in May to
OL,8,Fmake it "more representative" of it as
OL,9,Fa whole-body condition.
OL,11,FThe government said its trial clinic
OL,12,Fwould not diagnose the condition, but
OL,13,Fhelp those with PMOS to get further
OL,14,Fhelp with it and associated conditions,
OL,15,Fincluding type 2 diabetes.
